      "writtenOn": "2020-10-12T09:51:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is strongly discouraged in tests :\n• Looper expects loop() to be called afterwards but you can\u0027t do this or the test will spin forever, so you have a half initialized object.\n• It will look like you have a looper prepared but it\u0027s not actually sending events, which can easily break some production code.\n• You can never quit this looper.\n\nCan you use an instance of TestLooper instead ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1095,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 1095,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "df7f4a3ab57d83ff35a170404882c31fab8db9e1",
